Snapshot browser events before deferred dispatch.

Adapted from Qt commit e2ac21456a906684b4edc588412038c4fc4b69e4
by Morten Sørvig <morten.sorvig@qt.io>:
https://github.com/qt/qtbase/commit/e2ac21456a906684b4edc588412038c4fc4b69e4

Qt 6.10 also reads composedPath() in its deferred platform handler, so
preserve that transient value as well. Non-Event timer arguments pass through.
Skip deprecated Firefox mouse getters; Qt reads standard PointerEvent fields.
The upstream source file retains its original copyright and license notices.

